flowchart TD
    U[Authenticated caller] --> S[Spring Security]
    S --> C[Financial API adapter]
    C --> V{Query shape valid?}
    V -->|No| Q[Framework VALIDATION_ERROR 400]
    V -->|Yes| A[Financial application service]

    A --> R{Role allowed before lookup?}
    R -->|No| F[FINANCIAL_OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED 403]
    R -->|Yes| L{Select lookup by authority}

    L -->|Administrator read| G[Global lookup]
    L -->|Startup operation| SU[Identifier and startup scoped lookup]
    L -->|Investor read| IN[Identifier and investor scoped lookup]

    G --> X{Resource found?}
    SU --> X
    IN --> X
    X -->|No repayment| N[REPAYMENT_NOT_FOUND 404]
    X -->|No installment| NI[REPAYMENT_INSTALLMENT_NOT_FOUND 404]
    X -->|Yes| B[Evaluate financial state after authority]

    B -->|Initially not payable| P[REPAYMENT_INSTALLMENT_NOT_PAYABLE 409]
    B -->|Allowed| T[Execute conditional transition]

    Q --> H[Shared RFC 9457 adapter]
    F --> H
    N --> H
    NI --> H
    P --> H
    H --> D[Allowlisted Problem Details]

